# @vprprudhvi/shared-__name__

Shared library. `rush new --library __name__` made this package.

## Use

1. Add the package to a project: `rush add -p @vprprudhvi/shared-__name__`.
2. Import from the package root: `import { packageName } from '@vprprudhvi/shared-__name__';`.

## Change

- Put the code in `src/`. Export the public API from `src/index.ts` only.
- Put the tests in `test/`. The path under `test/` mirrors `src/`.
- Run `rush verify --to @vprprudhvi/shared-__name__`.
